   "source": [
    "## Model vs Baseline\n",
    "\n",
    "The Random Forest model was trained using the same training and testing split as the baseline. Mean Absolute Error (MAE) is used for comparison because it directly measures average prediction error.\n",
    "\n",
    "Lower MAE indicates better predictive performance."
   ]
  },
